WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.802 --> 00:00:04.872
Jackie worried all week about her problem with Howler. She felt bad about her

2
00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:10.433
argument with Hudson too, but the show was coming up fast. "I'll focus

3
00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:17.791
on my dog problem first," she told herself. Later she'd fix the friend problem.

4
00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:23.114
On Friday she tried running Howler uphill. For once, he trotted the entire time—but

5
00:00:23.115 --> 00:00:30.026
it was hard for a dog to run uphill without trotting. As soon

6
00:00:30.027 --> 00:00:34.688
as she brought him back to the show ring, he started pacing again. Jackie

7
